<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoValueGetReal</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to retrieve a real-number value</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Value.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">double SilikoValueGetReal(
    const SilikoValue *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoValueGetReal</function> function gets the
real-number value of <varname>object</varname>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoValueGetReal</function> returns the real-number
  value of <varname>object</varname> if <varname>object</varname>
  holds a real-number value. If <varname>object</varname> does not
  hold a real-number token, then
  <function>SilikoValueGetReal</function> returns a NaN (not a number)
  value.</para>
</refsection>
